# The mirror over the hole, from where you get up (BOOT_ON_FOOT: you face out, so a half turn
# first: 1.6 s of left, as corridor_still.steps), walking up to it and
# looking up: over the reflected corridor the glass shows the CD block's disc (what's behind you),
# not the landmarks behind the arena. And the tunnel the corridor comes out of the pyramid by: its
# sloped ceiling and cheeks over the walls. Then back out under the duct: the mirror's gone
